msgid ""
"Enter the supplier's delivery note or shipment reference related to this "
"receipt. This does not sync automatically with the supplier reference in the"
" purchase order."
msgstr ""
"Vnesi dobavnico ali sklic pošiljke dobavitelja, povezano s tem potrdilom. To "
"se ne samodejno sinhronizira s sklicem dobavitelja v nabavnem nalogu."

